## Global options

| Option | Short | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| `--version` | | Print installed version and exit |
| `--verbose` | `-v` | Enable DEBUG-level log output |
| `--debug` | `-d` | Dump all parsed arguments before running the command |

